# The cast (048): presets made with the kit, built from the parts each time the app starts, so a better part makes better people. They show as stamps under Characters.
# A preset names a part for each slot, up to two accessories, an outline (none, dark or sel), and colors for any role, as "role = Palette / Ramp".
# Roles a preset leaves out take kit.px's colors. Starter art by Claude.

preset: small-baker
name: Baker
template: small
body: average
head: round
eyes: dots
hair: bun
top: apron
bottom: leggings
shoes: sneakers
skin = Skin and hair / Pale skin
hair = Skin and hair / Red hair
cloth-a = Greens
cloth-b = Neutrals

